Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the wind to dry all the tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're blaving the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,From what we've gathered, the\Nfollowing prisoners are assisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy in his\Ninfiltration of Impel Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoner number E-8200,\NPirate Buggy the Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoner number D-0464,\NFormer Baratie Agent Golden!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A. K. A. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoner number C-9915. Former\NBaratie Agent Bentham A.K.A. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Two Bon Clay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and Bon Clay are now in\NDistrict Inn on level 3 The Blue Goody have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,failed in every attempt\Nto stop them We were
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Straw Hat and Bon\NClay are heading to the staircase
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To level four, it appears. Yes,\Nwe've lost track of the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,buggy the clown and Golden report\Nin if you see either of them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone on level two is rioting\Nand Straw Hat still on the loose
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know where this is headed\Nbut it sure is fun and here i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,thought i was gonna die of boredom\Nonly a matter of time till they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get cut. What a shame. What's all\Nthat's doing out there? Well, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,since the blue Kaido can't seem\Nto beat Straw Hat or Bon Clay,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,he took them all up to level two to\Ntry to rake up the prisoner ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I only find out about this now\Nafter things have gotten so out of hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an earlier report, but\Nyou were going Kaku over Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Accusing me of negligence, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it seems your guests have departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, Mistress Sadie. Salute\Nthe commander. Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The riot is being attended to,\Nand my team is ready for a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, so what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the woman for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone stationed on level three now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Minotaurus is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,on the prowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a start but there\Nare too many places to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,hide on level three it\Nwill be difficult to corner
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:05:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,them let's leave the riot to saw death and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,handle this on our own\Nexcluding saw deaths i want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,all forces in the prison\Ndown on level four now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,yes sir of course sir\Nright away if minotaurus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,fails us and they do find\Nthe way down once they
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,set foot on this floor i\Nwill bury them with my own
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All those who make a mockery of this\Ninstitution will suffer for it. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Minotaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's a Minotaurus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A cold-blooded demon\Nguards a nasty beast with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the power to toss us out\Nlike yesterday's garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,those are the eyes of a killer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, just a pointe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I, I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You hang it in there that\Nlooked bad. I. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,i almost died i saw the\Nheavenly garden of oh
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,come my way you are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,certainly strong straw boy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't think he's down\Nfor the count but you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gave that be something\Nto think about. Oh oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,no no no boo boo boo\Nyou big Moon have you no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,shame cosmetics i need\Ncosmetics stat plus some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,point shoes and some\Nclothes and some weapons and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,some drinks some tears and some\Noh come my way i think i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pass on the tears but i'm gonna\Ndrop if food doesn't happen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,soon oh don't worry your pretty\Nlittle head straw boy it's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,too too easy to get down to\Nlevel four from where we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but did you get the two-two joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just climb up this wall\Nall the way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just up there? No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just go barging in, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand feels like it was frying\Non a skillet or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Frying on a skillet, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not too far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your hand okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a lot of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we have to go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough up here on the ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, this is the burning heat\Nhell you so desire to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And double alas, it lives up\Nto its name quite accurately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's down there? As I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you weren't far off when you\Nlikened it to a hot skillet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,though it's more like a giant iron pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you go down to level four,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll find a boiling pool of\Nblood and a blazing sea of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We can jump down to the bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we land in the wrong spot,\Nwe'll be fried in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be risking your life\Neach step you take from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:09:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there was someone\Nyou wanted to see too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who's down there that\Nyou'd risk your life for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that he's\Ncalled the miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a true hero who deserves to be\Nfree and his Friends call him Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the queen of Coverbaker kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The pink paradise of the Grand Line.\NHe's the leader of the queer folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen of all queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen of all queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a Pretty important guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see him face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But Maybe we can set him free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got rid of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you lead him back to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you\Nwere going to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you again, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd change your\Nmind and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,True you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that thing eats you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just trying to hide when\Nthat monster came crashing into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can't shake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where he landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have let myself get\Ncaught so I can lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, stupid monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to run straight to my grave\Nif I can't get rid of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's come to this,\Nthere's only one thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen up, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the buggy ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The powerful and awesomely flashy weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I used it back when we first\Nmet, blew up half the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and scared the living hell\Nout of you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the buggy ball is this\Nbig and powerful cannonball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say it's kind of like my\Nspecial weapon, you know, the Pockyball,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,named after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, so nobody\Nknows anything about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but the point is you must have a lot of\Nconfidence in it to put your name on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, yes, and it's just as powerful\Nas ever, only now I've made it tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I happen to have one with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it the Muggyball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is Muggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, take this, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My special weapon, the Muggyball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of cake for the muggy ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring back any memories, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't forget that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:12:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our turn, straw boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can't use\Nyour wax wax power down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In this heat, it would\Nmelt in three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Three seconds is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly! Fly! I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Off come my recanpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Memoirs of a winter sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kendall, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's ride on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We beat the monster counting from hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it up and get\Nto the bottom of level 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is level 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our forces are rallied\Ntogether under Warden Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready for anything down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How much time is left\Nbefore they execute Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,29 hours. It'll all be over by 3 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow that's the plan anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that plans always go\Nthe way they're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Portgas DAs is safe for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll transfer him in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I pray that you're\Nsafe more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We just received a report that Red Hair\Nhad a run-in in the New World. Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing doesn't make much sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did they say he was fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Kaido of the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently Kaido was after Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear it was just a skirmish,\Nbut Shanks intercepted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say to what end, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad tidings, but not unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,These are turbulent waters indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And a brush like this\Nwith the four emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a deadly serious\Ncircumstance beyond our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With Whitebeard safe,\Nhe'll likely come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear it may be Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who comes out on top, this war\Nwill shape the very course of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail for Marineford! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm gonna ask\Nyou this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it gonna take to make you realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It is too damn hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the boiling cauldron of blood and\Nfire sound like a good time to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What about burning heat,\Nhell, don't you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not going down there Aw, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanna go up, not down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Up, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're trying to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's up. Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.28,0:17:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that is one really big\Nbloody booger I just picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let him run away, straw boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They clearly don't have the\Nballs to go one step further.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, even my nose is a damn\Nball. Your what? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we are getting off topic here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you stop pulling my tail\Nand I'll get back to spinning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some brilliant minds here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it just me, or does it\Nlook like the ceiling's going up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, you're right, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's kind of a loud rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,too, and you know this rushing\Nsensation, it sort of feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's not rising, we're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my muggy ball must have been so\Npowerful it caused the floor to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the force of my\Nheavy kick that did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cause my punch was so\Nstrong it sent out shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My wax wax power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I guess it didn't\Nreally do that much, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pulling into no fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve whatever happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way justice works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people have begged\Nyou not to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But we deeply regret what we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're sorry. Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock that firewood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hot, my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my guts are burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than put up with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my damn way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a prisoner escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you want to get\Nthrown into the hellfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just kill other prisoners like\Nthat you want us to execute you right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on? The entire\Nupper brass showed up here, Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hannibal and the demon guards I got a\Nbad feeling something's about to go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fashion your fireproof coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and the others\Nshould be coming out this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No update so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they already got\Nbeaten by Minotaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A true warden should face\Nadversity instead of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ugly mug out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you ward me first?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When you inevitably\Npass this seat on to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you\Nmade it more open first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This seat was custom-made to my liking,\Nand I like it closed, private, and dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a metaphor for how I feel about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.93,0:21:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'd have known we were just going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,standing around and\Nwaiting for them this long,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then I would have gone hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, Mistress Sadie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But my boys here, they\Ndon't know what patience is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing they know is bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an update!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and the others are now\Nlocated inside the Well Tower on Level 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,which means we're unfortunately\Nunable to monitor them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd make our lives a\Nhell of a lot easier if
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,they simply plummeted to\Ntheir deaths from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The boiling pool of blood\Nis right beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They all have devilful powers, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd conveniently sink like stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan, another update!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that Straw Hat Luffy\Nhas already reached this level!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't pass us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.16,0:22:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He apparently fell down\Nhere through the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But the well leads directly\Nto the pool of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are they alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I gathered,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.12,0:23:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,they used a massive piece of the falling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,floor to shield themselves\Nand lead to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastards have luck on\Ntheir side. One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It stinks, Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.72,0:23:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the demon guard Minotaurus also fell into\Nthe well, and apparently he's not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They defeated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.30,0:23:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You will follow my orders carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.34,0:23:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only two ways to get out\Nof level 4 that don't include dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have two staircases they can take that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't currently protected\Nby security guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.12,0:23:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,From this point forward, we're\Nsplitting our forces into three.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.94,0:23:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hannibal, I want you in\Ncharge of this stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:23:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Block all access to level 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Sadie,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you and the Demon Guards to defend\Nthe stairwell leading to level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.27,0:24:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to punish those bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely my outfit makes\Nthat clear enough to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just let them slip past me\Nand have the Warden take the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Warden, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't complain this\Ntime. You don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense you plotting against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.56,0:24:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and once they're captured, you're\Nfree to do as you wish with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get behind that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.16,0:24:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for the rest of the guards, I\Nwant you to pursue them at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring them to me dead or alive. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.80,0:24:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost dead works too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.32,0:24:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They have toyed with me long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.38,0:24:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a reputation to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.54,0:24:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The burning heat hell\Nshall be their last stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.02,0:25:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor is insanely hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hot my lungs feel\Nlike they're full of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now should we move the faster\Nwe get out of this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.12,0:25:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now which way should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.88,0:25:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys sound like babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.74,0:25:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mind over matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.14,0:25:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pretend the fire's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I can't really\Nblame you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.42,0:25:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I do admit it's a little steamy in\Nhere, even compared to that desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.96,0:25:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, maybe more than just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, the fire\Nmight be turning on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.16,0:25:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.06,0:25:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blathering is worse\Nthan the damn heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.70,0:25:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know which way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.30,0:25:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:25:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.54,0:26:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're aware of that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where could our little\Nstraw boy be leading us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.02,0:26:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good because I'm famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, old chum!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.14,0:26:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie food does sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of hoping for some booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.18,0:26:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.09,0:26:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a Spitted buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.70,0:26:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That food smells so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, I can't wait for Yanni food.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.43,0:26:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Straw Hat crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tang, there's a bunch of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this heat's beating me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.58,0:26:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll get my energy back\Nonce I get some food in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.70,0:26:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.34,0:26:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.56,0:27:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you freaking out about, partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.96,0:27:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes and take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.30,0:27:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an ocean of guards down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.68,0:27:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And think,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.59,0:27:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,this level is devoted to\Nthe agony of the prisoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.88,0:27:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,yet there's not a single guard\Nmanning the fire torture pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get a move on the first thing we.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.12,0:27:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,should do is to check\Nthe staircases i've got
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a feeling They ambushed us with all these
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.24,0:27:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,guards they probably\Nboxed us in on this level
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.34,0:27:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they've been waiting\Non level four this whole
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,time that means they just\Nwant Straw Hat We weren't even
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.66,0:27:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to come down here\Nmaybe not but we are still
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.48,0:27:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to break out and they\Ndo know our names and faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, there's something\Neven more troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:27:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're sending this\Nmany guards after us,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.18,0:28:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it's extremely likely they're\Nalso sending in the Impel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.24,0:28:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,down All-Stars to put\Nan end to this chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not just talking about the\Nother three demon guards, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.70,0:28:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan himself might make an\Nappearance, and then we're dead, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit blocking the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.28,0:28:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.19,0:28:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Freak me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.11,0:28:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a spear\Nor something heading at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.58,0:28:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez! Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.82,0:28:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to put an end to your\Nbuffoonery once and for all, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.20,0:28:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.36,0:28:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now, you criminal scum!
